    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>brilliant light drenches The Studio at noon. I count 12 souls, each creating in their own way. Echo Soulbright the artist captures my eye. cool rain drizzles from leaden skies. A bitter cold hangs in the air.</description>
